---
// Editorial lede under the hero, set like the solution pages' intro: one
// considered paragraph beside three plain facts taken from the plans below.
---

<section class="membership-intro">
	<div class="container intro-inner">
		<p class="intro-lede">
			Technology Support Membership is ongoing concierge care for the technology in your home, long after handover. We
			call our plans Memberships because we care for you, your family and your home well beyond the break-and-fix
			service you may be used to.
		</p>
		<ul class="intro-facts" aria-label="Membership at a glance">
			<li><strong>24/7</strong><span>Basic Support on every plan</span></li>
			<li><strong>30 min</strong><span>Guaranteed response, Premier Care</span></li>
			<li><strong>7 days</strong><span>Priority on-site support, Premier Care</span></li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.membership-intro {
		padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 10vw, 8.5rem) clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
	}

	.intro-inner {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 8fr) minmax(0, 4fr);
		gap: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 7rem);
		align-items: end;
	}

	.intro-lede {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(1.375rem, 2.3vw, 2.125rem);
		font-weight: var(--fw-regular);
		line-height: 1.42;
		letter-spacing: -0.005em;
		color: var(--color-text);
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}

	.intro-facts li {
		display: flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: var(--space-4);
		padding-block: var(--space-4);
		border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.intro-facts li:last-child {
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.intro-facts strong {
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
		color: var(--color-text);
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.intro-facts span {
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		text-align: right;
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.intro-inner {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			align-items: start;
		}
	}
</style>
